# YouTube Data API v3 key, used by the featured-channel footer banner to fetch
# the latest upload from the featured channel. Generate one in Google Cloud
# Console (APIs & Services > Credentials), enable the "YouTube Data API v3",
# and restrict the key by HTTP referrer to your deployed domain.
# If unset, the banner falls back to a pinned static video.
VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
